<title>USA: Motorola, Control Data get contract.</title>
<headline>Motorola, Control Data get contract.</headline>
<dateline>ARDEN HILLS, Ill. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Control Data Systems Inc and Motorola Inc's Space and Systems Technology Group said Monday they were awarded a contract by the Public Works and Government Services Canada to develop a national Military Messaging Handling System (MMHS).</p>
<p>Terms of the contract were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MMHS will enable the Canadian Department of National Defence to process and disseminate military messages, including security classification, Control Data said.</p>
<p>Control Data said it will provide the mail and messaging system based on its Rialto Messaging line of products.</p>
<p>The project is scheduled to finish testing in Ottawa in September 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
